note contract 5 layout line 158 with erratum E5: a field declared with COUNT 1 is an array and
note needs an index; `put x fa v` without one is error 4 (missing index, erratum E8).
om2
layout one1 4
field fa uint 1 at 0 big
end
fn fill x edit one1 to void
put x fa 0x01020304
end
fn main to int
c = new uchar 4 0
fill c
ret 0
end
